{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgSoQx18toVtY96FADzPK","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I updated both files and changed nothing else; the other `reference/` files showing as modified belong to the parallel lane writers.\n\n- **`reference/techniques/warmups.md`**: Added the Day 27 \"Monkey Business\" entry. The blob was Ook!, which is Day 26's exact Brainfuck program rewritten as `Ook.`/`Ook!` word pairs (only three pairs used, no `Ook?`). Single solve was correct in about 33 s, and Time Trial (4.4 s) and Mastery (133 sets × 27 lines, 38.2 s) were correct first try. Day 27 also turned one setting of the previous day without a \"Same\"/\"Another\" cue in the prompt, which I noted. I merged the Day 26/27 variant axis into \"esoteric program + its spelling\" with one parse rule, and added an Ook recognition cue and pitfalls. I also shortened the Day 12–22 entries, bringing the file from 267 to 254 lines (the ~200 target isn't reached).\n- **Near miss worth fixing**: the Day 27 solver repeated Day 26's Mastery bug. Its line-27 encoder doesn't reproduce the Game Master's bytes, so all 133 sets took the slow fallback: 34.9 s of the 60 s limit. It passed only because lib's Day 26 entry had been fixed overnight. lib already has an encoder that reproduces the Game Master's bytes (`bfd_enc(s, \"ook\")`); the `mastery-bf-line-26` gap now tells tomorrow's solver to use it.\n- **`reference/coverage/warmups.md`**: Marked rows 83 and 183 (Brainfuck / Ook!) seen on Day 27 and removed the Ook gap from the readiness list. I rewrote the forecast for Day 28 onward and added rows 192–200 with 9 new prebuild gaps not built yet. Priority 1: re-decoding a program's output when it is itself encoded, unknown or emoji token spellings, Brain-Flak, and Chicken. Below that: Spoon, Boolfuck, Headsecks/Wordfuck, print-statement languages, and Unlambda/Thue. The gaps JSON parses and the recognition-cues section is exactly 60 lines."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":907,"cache_read_input_tokens":131111,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":907},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"20e4578b-af83-47db-a5d2-12b070c2e725","uuid":"ec8af61d-ec10-4f09-a72e-9fda7d08ac96","timestamp":"2026-10-27T13:13:33.093Z","request_id":"req_011CgSoQwYcCzrUG1GTmaXXh"}
